+---
+id: PROP-102
+type: proposal
+title: Show the total in US dollars
+status: open
+stage: null
+touches: [CRT-002]
+violates: []
+changed: []
+questions: []
+---
+Show the cart total in US dollars next to the euro total, using the exchange rate from Frankfurter, another company's public exchange-rate API.
+The app asks Frankfurter for the EUR to USD rate and shows the total times the rate, in whole cents, rounded half up.
+When Frankfurter cannot be reached, the dollar total is not shown and the euro total stays as it is.
